            "detailed_description": "<strong>Eipix Entertainment</strong> presents the next heart-pounding chapter of the beloved <i>Dark Parables</i> series!<br><br>It's the eve of Gerda and Gwyn's wedding, but a rogue arsonist is setting the Mountain Kingdom's forests on fire! Your investigation will take you deep within the forest where a dangerous artifact will be unearthed, one that could spell doom for the whole world! An old friend will surface and his deepest desires will determine the fate of the Mountain Kingdom. Be careful what you wish for in this spectacular hidden-object puzzle adventure game!<br><br>•\tRid the Snow Kingdom of its legendary nemesis in the bonus game!<br>•\tReplay puzzles, mini-games, and hidden-object scenes!<br>•\tUnlock bonus challenges, souvenirs, and collectibles!<br>•\tGet original artwork, music, and video content!<br>•\tAccess the helpful Strategy Guide!",
